  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 150eb (Expensive) per dose<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Street Drug</p>\n<p>Primary (1 hour): take 1d6 Humanity Loss, returned if you avoid the Secondary Effect; you ignore the Seriously Wounded state. Secondary (DV17): the Humanity Loss isn't returned; addiction. While addicted and not on S-KEEF: REF -2. Only works through a MaxDoc Inhaler, not Airhypos, Arrowhypo ammo, Multihypos, or similar, though it can go in Airburst ammo and other aerosol delivery.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>While addicted, switch on the \"S-KEEF Addiction\" effect.</li>\n<li>When an addicted character doses, use \"S-KEEF Addicted Primary\" instead of the normal primary effect; it cancels the withdrawal penalties for the duration.</li>\n<li>Stat and skill changes are automated; caps, minimums, durations, and everything else are not.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; Consumables &gt; Street Drugs).</em></p>"
